{"id":"vod_sn_35951","vodId":"35951","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"去吧！稻中桌球社","name_cn":"去吧！稻中桌球社","date":"1995-01-01","year":"1995","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3869a8d8bf927f5bea402dbea636c81a.jpg"},"summary":"故事講述日本稻豐中學乒乓球社所發生的事。故事主角是前野、井澤、田中、田邊、竹田、木之下等六位男社員，後來加入了岩下與神谷兩位女社員。情節環繞青少年對性與愛情的興趣與好奇探索，以及許許多多的惡作劇。這些惡作劇大多不怕髒，在衝動的時候甚至不計限度。另一個常見的題材是幾個年輕的人物將增廣見聞當作人生的嚴肅目標；即使是大多數人懶得去關心的事物，他們也很熱心的要親身體驗。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g3ATxtzW871/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uJxn7c3ee41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hL1E10YJf41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iE3tgNUC7d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d8NVvKGwg31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jP4QFHKCkf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dGsYmnBTSs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9vf2gaPVwk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3u098Dmj8f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u9B5ukJG641/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0AgsZ3Q4jc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9xu0cgr9mr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Z6wcecRRZ21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jfeYi9jrpW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Z1YAUL5rMJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https: